    - rid: 3602687399754203875
      type: {class: TextFieldValue, ns: AStergio.OmniCard.Runtime.Cards.Fields.Values, asm: AStergio.OmniCard.Runtime}
      data:
        Field: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3efd2d64903b6a748b6cc9d9d595c29f, type: 2}
        Value: 'Confiscate: it appraises up to 3 copies of your most-numerous force
          into its Mantle; attacks gain +1 Force per 3 held. Hits of 5+ shake a card
          loose. Only the draw pile is read - discard, pocket and wounds are invisible
          to it.'
    - rid: 3602687399754203876
      type: {class: TextFieldValue, ns: AStergio.OmniCard.Runtime.Cards.Fields.Values, asm: AStergio.OmniCard.Runtime}
      data:
        Field: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb2ae876f39ca7b4ba6bbea3221ce629, type: 2}
        Value: A vast pale hand in a sleeve of ledgers. It doesn't want you dead;
          it wants your assets.
